# Keep the Docker build context (repo root, see docker-compose.yml build.context)
# free of runtime state and local artifacts: the deploy/1panel/chordv volumes grow
# with production data (releases, postgres, snapshots) and .env carries secrets —
# none of them belong in image builds. The Dockerfiles COPY explicit paths only
# (apps/, packages/, scripts/, SYSTEM_VERSION, deploy/1panel/chordv/*-entrypoint*.sh,
# admin.nginx.conf), which stay outside these exclusions.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.env
deploy/1panel/chordv/releases
deploy/1panel/chordv/postgres-data
deploy/1panel/chordv/api-state
deploy/1panel/chordv/api-public-state
deploy/1panel/chordv/api-backups
apps/desktop
apps/node-agent
docs
output
.deploy
*.log
